# Changelog

## 0.2.0

- Add glob-based PDF filtering against Zotero attachment titles.
- Update README branding and plugin assets.
- Preserve absolute Obsidian paths on macOS.
- Show export progress after the folder-name prompt so it remains visible on macOS.
- Improve export diagnostics for MinerU and Obsidian stages.
- Localize all Super-Scholar UI in Zotero for English and Simplified Chinese.

## 0.1.1

- Fix repeated Zotero library context menu activation by using a stable legacy menu item path.
- Use Zotero prompt service with correct out parameters for Obsidian folder naming.

## 0.1.0

- Add pull request release discipline checks.
- Publish GitHub releases from main branch pushes using CHANGELOG notes.
- Generate release tags, XPI packages, and Zotero update manifests in CI.
- Publish plugin.
